    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oburuchi bwaHezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mumuyika kwakhataru kwaHoshea waEla, omuruchi waIsiraeli, Hezekia waAhazi, omuruchi waYuda, yachaaka okhuruka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yali owemiyika amakhumi kabili nachiraano olwa yachaaka okhuruka, naruchila emiyika amakhumi kabili nashienda eYerusalemu; ne eliira lianyina liali Abi waZekaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yakhola akali amalayi mumoni tSiOMWAMI, kosi aka Daudi kuukanyene yakholanga shinga olwa kali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarusiaho habundu aheechingu hosi, nasasaka amachina amasongokhu, narema omuAshera; nasasaka ebitonye ebitonye inzokha eyo eya Musa yakhola; okhuba okhuula khundaalo etsio abaana baIsiraeli bali nibachisambilanga amalesi kelibuuliesi; yalangungwa mbu Nehushitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yali nasuubililanga OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli; kata inyumawe shiyaliho owafwanana ninaye mubaruchi bosi baYuda ta, kata mubamuranjilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba yahanda khuMWAMI; shiyalekha okhumulonda ta, ne yalindanga amalakoke, aka OMWAMI yamulaka Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI naba ninaye halala; hosi hosi ewa yarula okhutsia, yakaasanga. Yakholela omuruchi waAshuru induli, naramukhalabanila ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarootsa abaFilisiti okhuula eGaza nomumbali mwalio, okhurula khumunaara kwomulindi okhuula khwitaala liolukoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhukwisibwa khwaSamaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumuyika kwakhane kwomuruchi Hezekia, okwali omuyika kwomusaafu kwaHoshea waEla, omuruchi waIsiraeli, Salimaneseri omuruchi waAshuru yatikulukha okhuseera Samaria, naliikalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana emiyika olwa chiali nichihweele chitaru balibukula; mbu mumuyika kwakhasasaba kwaHezekia, okwali omuyika kwashienda kwaHoshea omuruchi waIsiraeli, Samaria liabukulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi waAshuru niyaara abaIsiraeli mushialo shiabwe nabayila eAshuru, nabara muHala nende khuHabori, omwalo kwaGozani, khandi mumataala kabaMedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila shibahulilanga omwoyo kwOMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe ta, habula bakhayanga indakanoye, niyo kosi aka Musa omusumba wOMWAMI yali niyalaka, oburachihulila kata okhuchikhola ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Senakheribu yaseera eshialo, niyeenjilamwo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumuyika kwekhumi nakhane kwomuruchi Hezekia, Senakheribu omuruchi waAshuru yatikulukha okhuseera amataala kosi kaYuda aketsingoba, nakabukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Hezekia omuruchi waYuda yakhupila omuruchi waAshuru omunwa eLakhishi, ari Enzonoonile; oshiukhane, undeshe; aka naunduushe kosi ndaleefwila. Kho omuruchi waAshuru yamulaka Hezekia omuruchi waYuda okhurunga tsitalanda ebikhumi bitaru tsieifeetsa netsitalanda amakhumi kataru tsieitsahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Hezekia namuheelesia if eetsa yosi eyanyoolekha munzu yOMWAMI, khandi mumabiishilo keinzu yomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsio Hezekia yakhalaka itsahaabu yosi eyali niyili khunzichi tsieihekalu yOMWAMI, khandi khubiyindi ebia Hezekia omuruchi waYuda yali nafuumile, naheelesia omuruchi waAshuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi waAshuru yaruma omutaritaniwe, nomurabusarisi, nomurabushake, ewomuruchi Hezekia eYerusalemu okhurula eLakhishi, halala nende lihe likhongo liabaseeri. Nibatikulukha niboola eYerusalemu. Ne olwa bali nibatikuluushe, batsia nibasinjila ahambi nende omuferechi kwelitiba liemukulu, elili khumuhanda kweshianyi shiomwosii wetsingubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa bali nibamulaniile omuruchi, Eliakimu waHilikia yarula nabeetsela, oyo owali niyasinjilila itookho, nende Shebina omuhandiichi, nende Yoa waAsafu omuhandiichi, omulindi wamakhuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omurabushake oyo nabasunjila ari Bulaano mumuboolele Hezekia mbu Kano niko aka omuruchi omukhongo, omuruchi waAshuru, aboola; mbu Nobwisiichi shiina buno obwa wisiikanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okaalanga mbu amakhuwa namakhuwa kalimwo obwibaali nende amaani khulwa lihe. Ne bulaano, owa wisiikanga niwina, ouchila niukholela induli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulaano lola, wisiikanga omutiichilo okwo kwolusi olufwoneeshe, mbu Misiri, okwa omundu naba niyeeleetakhwo, kuleenjila mumukhonokwe nikumufumira; nolwa Farao omuruchi waMisiri ali khubeenabo bosi abamwisiikanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa nimuba nimumboolela mbu Khumwisiikanga OMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe; kho shiali ye owa Hezekia yarusiyeho habunduwe hachinguukhu hosi nende ebimalilobie biemisango, nabiila abaYuda nende abaYerusalemu ari Mureenamilanga imbeli weshimalilo shino muYerusalemu, nohomba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano, chama omusinjile omwami wanje omuruchi waAshuru omusingo, nasi ndalakhuheelesia tsifarasi ebikhumila bibili, iwe noba nonyala khululwo okhuniiniakhwo abandu abakhatsichendelakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe wakhanyala orie okhukaya kata omwimilisi mulala kata oushila obutuutu mubasumba bomwami wanje, olwa wisiikanga Misiri okhunyoolelayo amakaari nende abachendela khufarasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi bulaano endikuluushe okhuseera habundu hano nokhumululaho, aharali OMWAMI, noho? OMWAMI niye owambiila mbu Tikulukha oseere eshialo shino noshimulula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Eliakimu waHilikia, naShebina, naYoa, basunjila omurabushake oyo bari Chama oboolele abasumbabo muluAshuru; okhuba khuluhulilanga; ne oraboolana nineefu mululimi lwabaYahudi, abandu abali khulukoba nibahulila, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omurabushake oyo nababoolela ari Omwami wanje yaruma khumwami weenywe, khandi khwinywe, okhusunga amakhuwa kano, noho? Shiyayaruma khubandu abeekhaale khulukoba, mbu balie khubibii biabwe abeene, nibanywa khumeenyali kabwe abeene, halala nineenywe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omurabushake oyo nasinjila, nachinga omwoyo mululimi lwabaYahudi, nasunga mbu Muhulile amakhuwa komuruchi omukhongo, omuruchi waAshuru! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka omuruchi aboola, mbu Murafuchiilila Hezekia amukaatie, okhuba shinanyale okhumuhonia mumukhono kwanje ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata murafuchiilila Hezekia amutinyisie muMWAMI, ari OMWAMI shialachweya okhukhuhonia tawe; litookho lino shiliitsa okhuhaanwa mumukhono kwomuruchi waAshuru ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murarechelesia akaHezekia tawe; okhuba kano niko aka omuruchi waAshuru aboola, mbu Mwisasaanie ninasi, murule munzitsile; mana muliitsenje buli mundu khumutsabibukwe, khandi buli mundu khumukhuyukwe, nimunyweetsanga buli mundu khumatsi akomwiyabo lilie omwene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuula olwa ndakheetse, nimuyila mushialo eshifwanana nende eshialo shieenywe abeene, eshialo shieimele nende idivai, eshialo shiebiokhulia nende emikunda chiemitsabibu, eshialo shiamafura kemitseituni nende obuushi, mbu mube mwoyo nimurafwa ta; kata murarechelesia akaHezekia ta, olwa amunichilisia, nasunga mbu OMWAMI alakhuhonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliho omunyasaye yesi welihanga liosi owahoniyekhwo eshibalashie mumukhono kwomuruchi waAshuru noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali heena abanyasaye baHamatsi, nabaArapadi? Bali heena abanyasaye baSefarawaimu, nabaHena, nabalwa? Bahoniye Samaria mumukhono kwanje noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubanyasaye bosi bebibala ebio, bali heena abahoniye eshibala shiabwe mumukhono kwanje, mbu OMWAMI yakhahonia Yerusalemu mumukhono kwanje?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
